 "person": [
  "keypad pause: lock the unit, type 5 wrong six-digit codes on the keypad: the sixth key does nothing for 30 s; power-cycle during the pause: still paused",
  "orientation: start a dance, lay the unit on its side: movement limits apply within a few seconds",
  "pairing confirm (build-linkpsk image only): pair with a host, type the code, the unit shows Keep this host? with Keep and Cancel",
  "locked unit: lock it, then self.wifi.list_saved and self.link.pair answer that the unit is locked",
  "SF107: with a game running, self.game.bench_tilt roll_pm 500 answers valid true and 500; clear answers 0, 0; gently tip the unit right: the reading grows positive"
 ],
 "goldens_ref": "origin/ux/unproven-games",
 "_notes": "Batch 1 as the coordinator defined it: review fixes SF103 to SF106, quick-actions migration SF101 and the analog tilt SF107 on top of main. (SF89 to SF99 are already on main.) The linkpsk image is build-linkpsk of the same tree."
